OL,3,GNEWSACouncil seeks permanent untaxed
OL,4,Avehicle powers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is set to formally adopt
OL,7,Fdevolved powers to remove and even
OL,8,Fdispose of untaxed vehicles following a
OL,9,Fpilot scheme.
OL,11,FChesterfield Borough Council said it
OL,12,Fseized 60 untaxed vehicles under
OL,13,Fdevolved powers from the Driver and
OL,14,FVehicle Licensing Agency (DVLA) during
OL,15,Fa six-month trial.
OL,17,FAccording to council papers, 24 of the
OL,18,Fvehicles were released to their owners
OL,19,Fand 34 were scrapped, with two still
OL,20,Fbeing processed.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
