OL,3,GNEWSACouncil seeks permanent untaxed
OL,4,Avehicle powers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said the scheme, which is
OL,7,Frecommended for permanent adoption at a
OL,8,Fmeeting on Tuesday, had also improved
OL,9,Fpublic safety by removing vehicles
OL,10,Flinked to poor roadworthiness,
OL,11,Fanti-social behaviour and criminal
OL,12,Factivity.
